        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk4-connectors-p06-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "甚至 + stronger case",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "甚至 adds a more extreme or less expected case on the same scale. Establish what makes that case stronger.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "他很忙，甚至没时间吃饭。",
                "pinyin": "tā hěn máng ， shènzhì méi shíjiān chī fàn 。",
                "meaning": "He is so busy that he does not even have time to eat.",
                "audio": "ec8f386efba91c8d7fb50a2d357f7dc0654d8b84dd5a11d22ee682ca9c049062"
              },
              {
                "text": "大家都来了，甚至老王也来了。",
                "pinyin": "dàjiā dōu lái le ， shènzhì lǎowáng yě lái le 。",
                "meaning": "Everyone came; even Lao Wang came.",
                "audio": "3184039cc75c8e178faabc45388a0d609cba6c8b052eea580068b00f9c523f5f"
              }
            ]
          },
